# ripgrep ignore file (also honoured by Claude Code's Grep/Glob, fd, ag). NOT read by git, npm,
# vitest, tsc, Biome or any build step — it only keeps history, generated copies and goldens out of
# symbol searches so a search lands on source first. Name a path explicitly to search it anyway
# (`rg foo CHANGELOG.md`), or pass `--no-ignore-dot`.

